Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嘿 请问…这是什么情况？\N{\rEng}Hey, what-- What is going on here, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我得对你们进行扫描\N{\rEng}I need to scan you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.19,0:00:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}拜托 先生 别动 先生\N{\rEng}Please, sir. Be still, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.05,0:00:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你可以进来了 没受感染\N{\rEng}You can come in. Still clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.93,0:00:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}感染什么？\N{\rEng}Clear of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.89,0:00:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不好意思…\N{\rEng}I'm sorry--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.77,0:01:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我是五大湖国民警卫队的杰斯特林格上校\N{\rEng}I'm Colonel Jay Stringer, Great Lakes National Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.57,0:01:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这位是疾控中心的 珍妮特夏普医生 请坐下？\N{\rEng}This is Dr. Janet Sharp from the CDC. Can you have a seat?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好的\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.03,0:01:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}三周前 芝加哥确诊了　第一起海玛艾托26病例\N{\rEng}Three weeks ago, the first case of Hema Aetho 26
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}三周前 芝加哥确诊了　第一起海玛艾托26病例\N{\rEng}was confirmed in Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}扩散速度惊人 是史上死亡率最高的病例之一\N{\rEng}It spread quickly, one of the highest fatality rates ever\Nrecorded.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.50,0:01:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}四天前 我们以为找到了那位零号病人\N{\rEng}Four days ago, we thought we identified our patient zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}她生前叫卡米拉霍德\N{\rEng}Her name was Camilla Holder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.38,0:01:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}“生前”是什么意思？　为什么说“生前”？什么意思？\N{\rEng}What do you mean "was"? What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们发现她的时候 她已经死了一段时间了\N{\rEng}By the time we found her, she had been dead for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.56,0:01:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}而且远早于此前记录的任何死亡案例\N{\rEng}Well before any previously-documented deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.48,0:01:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}很抱歉 但我必须这么做…\N{\rEng}I'm sorry to have to do this but…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们需要你确认这是不是你妹妹\N{\rEng}we need you to confirm that this is your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}是她\N{\rEng}That's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他们称之为黑鸢尾瘟疫\N{\rEng}They're calling it the Black Iris Plague.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你说你们以为找到了零号病人\N{\rEng}You said you thought you found patient zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.20,0:02:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 怎么了？   - 对不起 这都怪我\N{\rEng}- What?   - I'm sorry. It was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}都是我的错\N{\rEng}It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}对不起\N{\rEng}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他们之所以想让你亲眼辨认卡米拉\N{\rEng}The reason they wanted you to visually identify Camilla
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}是因为你和他\N{\rEng}is because you and him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.97,0:03:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}似乎都是瑞安霍德博士\N{\rEng}both appear to be Dr. Ryan Holder,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.56,0:03:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}而根据我们的记录\N{\rEng}who, according to our records,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.43,0:03:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这人十年前就已经死于一次超级高铁事故\N{\rEng}died ten years ago in a hyper loop accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这一个瑞安霍德 虽然后来死了\N{\rEng}This Ryan Holder, despite dying later,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.77,0:03:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}但他是第一个被感染的人 是我们的零号病人\N{\rEng}was the first infected, our patient zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们追踪了他的行踪\N{\rEng}We traced his movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.95,0:03:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他四周前刚从 希卡阿夸公园的立方体走出来\N{\rEng}He walked out of the Shikaakwa Park cube four weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}是跟你一起走出来的\N{\rEng}With you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}就像你们昨天那样\N{\rEng}Just like the two of you did yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.17,0:03:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}但你却没生病\N{\rEng}But you're not sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你明明已经死了 怎么现在会在这里？\N{\rEng}How can you be dead and here right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.22,0:03:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们理解你现在很震惊\N{\rEng}We understand you're in shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.85,0:03:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}但这个城市每天有两万人死去\N{\rEng}But the city is losing 20,000 people a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.19,0:03:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}接下来准备好接受更多的检测 和回答更多的问题\N{\rEng}There's gonna be further testing and many more questions to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.66,0:04:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}杰森二号说 我那个世界的杰森在走廊里做了选择\N{\rEng}Jason 2 said that my Jason made decisions in the Corridor
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}创造了其他不同版本的自己\N{\rEng}that created other versions of themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}对\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.67,0:04:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}就在我们抵达之前 其他版本的我们…\N{\rEng}Our other versions picked up this virus and brought it back…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.30,0:04:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}感染了这个病毒 并带回了这里\N{\rEng}before we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.56,0:04:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}是我害死了成千上万的人\N{\rEng}I'm responsible for the deaths of tens of thousands of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}还有我\N{\rEng}We both are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:40.67,TopDefault,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,32)}（改编自布莱克克劳奇的同名小说）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}那么 在你的那个人生 我离开了多久？\N{\rEng}So, in your life, how long have I been gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}15年\N{\rEng}Fifteen years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.51,0:06:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}在你的那个人生 你妈妈还活着吗？\N{\rEng}Is your mother alive in that life?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.80,0:06:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}死了\N{\rEng}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.77,0:06:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我的安妮四年前就去世了\N{\rEng}My Anne died four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.90,0:06:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}很遗憾\N{\rEng}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我现在好多了\N{\rEng}I'm better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}但每天依然很想念她\N{\rEng}I still miss her every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你怎么知道来这里找我？\N{\rEng}How did you know to come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我不知道\N{\rEng}I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我看到你的面包店 跟以前一模一样\N{\rEng}I saw the bakery and it looked the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.92,0:07:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我想我只是抱着希望\N{\rEng}I think I just hoped
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.96,0:07:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}希望这里也一样没变\N{\rEng}this place might be the same too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}但我没想过要让你看到我\N{\rEng}But I didn't mean for you to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}也许这不是实话\N{\rEng}Maybe that's not honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}也许是我太自私了\N{\rEng}Maybe I was being selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.23,0:07:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不管怎样\N{\rEng}Either way…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.28,0:07:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我知道现在的情况很复杂\N{\rEng}I know this is complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.95,0:07:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我真的很抱歉\N{\rEng}I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这是个完全超乎我意料的经历\N{\rEng}Well, it's an experience I didn't see coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}但我相信 相较于我 这情况对你来说更为复杂\N{\rEng}But I'm sure it's less complicated for me than it is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}现在 这情况正一点一点地 摧毁我们的关系\N{\rEng}Right now, it's kind of tearing us apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}而对于查理来说 他的整个世界都没了\N{\rEng}And Charlie, he lost his whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.19,0:07:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他真的很想念它\N{\rEng}He's really missing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.27,0:08:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}至于杰森 那盒子本身\N{\rEng}And for Jason, it's the box itself
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.82,0:08:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}变成了一种\N{\rEng}become like a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.15,0:08:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}控制不住的执念\N{\rEng}compulsion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你知道吗？他必须搞懂它\N{\rEng}He just needs to understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.45,0:08:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不管它造成的伤害有多大\N{\rEng}No matter how much damage it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.71,0:08:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}那你呢？\N{\rEng}And for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你比我更早看出来了\N{\rEng}You could see it before I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.46,0:08:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}它把我带回到一个…\N{\rEng}It's brought me back to someplace…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.05,0:08:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}古老的地方\N{\rEng}old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}小时候\N{\rEng}As a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.81,0:08:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我一直不知道\N{\rEng}I never knew
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}真正的父亲是谁\N{\rEng}which was the real version of my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}是善良的那个\N{\rEng}The one who was kind
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}还是那个…\N{\rEng}or the one who…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}伤害我的 你知道吗？\N{\rEng}hurt me, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:09:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}然后我被迫面对各种版本的丈夫\N{\rEng}Then I was faced with all these versions of my husband
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.09,0:09:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}一下子又把我拉回到了当年…\N{\rEng}and it just went right back to when I was…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}亲爱的\N{\rEng}Mija.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.44,0:09:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}爸\N{\rEng}Oh, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:09:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好的\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}拜托\N{\rEng}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.65,0:10:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}有人来帮帮我\N{\rEng}I just need some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.41,0:10:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}有人来帮帮我\N{\rEng}I just need some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.31,0:10:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}（欢迎你 旅者）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.85,0:11:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}天啊\N{\rEng}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.73,0:11:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我称它为金字塔\N{\rEng}I call it the Pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.82,0:11:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}为什么是金字塔？\N{\rEng}Why a pyramid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.66,0:11:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}马雅和埃及金字塔建造的初衷\N{\rEng}Well, the Mayan and Egyptian pyramids
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.49,0:11:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}就是通往来世的大门\N{\rEng}were literally built to be portals to the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.45,0:11:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}去其他的世界\N{\rEng}Other worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.87,0:11:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这名字似乎很贴切\N{\rEng}Seemed appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 而且这个形状更高效   - 说对了\N{\rEng}- And the shape was more efficient.   - There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.42,0:11:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}为自适应安全屏障腾出了一些表面积\N{\rEng}Saved some surface area for the adaptive shielding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}那是你吗？\N{\rEng}Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.43,0:11:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他是我这个项目的搭档\N{\rEng}My partner in this project.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你也太离谱了\N{\rEng}You are ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.06,0:12:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你一定就是布莱尔\N{\rEng}And you must be Blair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.19,0:12:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}第一个进入盒子的 对吧？\N{\rEng}First one in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.52,0:12:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}对\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}是的 我就是那个自告奋勇的傻子\N{\rEng}Yeah, I was the idiot who volunteered for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你好\N{\rEng}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.65,0:12:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}有机会的话 我想听听你的经历\N{\rEng}I would love to hear about your experience sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这又是什么？\N{\rEng}And what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.78,0:12:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 是世界图表   - 你在绘制这些世界的关系图？\N{\rEng}- It's a worlds chart.   - You're mapping them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}目前主要在做数据录入\N{\rEng}It's mostly data entry at this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不过我们希望以后 能用更有意义的方式来把这些信息整\N理好\N{\rEng}but eventually we hope to organize it in more meaningful ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.08,0:12:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你们绘制了多少个世界？\N{\rEng}How many have you mapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.54,0:12:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们造访了74个\N{\rEng}We've visited 74 worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这是HP-24\N{\rEng}This is HP-24.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}基本资料已经能够一目了然\N{\rEng}We have the basics at a glance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.10,0:12:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}谁造访过、何时造访过、科技资产\N{\rEng}Who visited, when, technological assets, which…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}而这是我们最感兴趣的\N{\rEng}is of primary interest to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.73,0:12:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}HP-24拥有最不可思议的智能城市\N{\rEng}HP-24 has the most incredible smart cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.15,0:12:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 要跟我们一起吃晚餐吗？   - 不了\N{\rEng}- You joining us for dinner?   - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.11,0:12:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们要和新的侦察队进行一次训练\N{\rEng}We have a training session with the new scout team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.20,0:13:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}那我们晚点再聊吧\N{\rEng}Well, I guess we'll catch up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.66,0:13:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}侦察队？\N{\rEng}Scouts?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.74,0:13:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们以前经常派侦察队出去执行任务\N{\rEng}Well, we used to send teams out on missions constantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.33,0:13:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}寻找有用的世界 建立交易\N{\rEng}trying to find useful worlds, setting up trades.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.38,0:13:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}大约一年前 我们就不再进去那个盒子了\N{\rEng}About a year ago, we stopped using the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.38,0:13:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这个大宝贝需要我们全力关注\N{\rEng}This bad boy needed all our attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}那是瑞安霍德吗？\N{\rEng}Is that Ryan Holder?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不是你认识的那个\N{\rEng}Not the one you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.09,0:13:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他是我在这个世界里招募的\N{\rEng}I recruited him from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}瑞安\N{\rEng}Ryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.22,0:13:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我想给你介绍一个朋友\N{\rEng}I want you to meet a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.85,0:13:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 她是布莱尔   - 你好\N{\rEng}- This is Blair.   - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你好\N{\rEng}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.90,0:13:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你认识另一个版本的我？\N{\rEng}Do you know another version of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.86,0:13:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}只是偶然碰见过\N{\rEng}Just in passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.23,0:13:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}瑞安正在开发一种贴片 能在30天内持续、可控地释放\N药物\N{\rEng}Ryan is developing a patch that does a 30-day, controlled release\Nof the drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.07,0:13:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 是的   - 药效能持续一个月？\N{\rEng}- Yeah.   - It lasts a month?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.86,0:13:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}甚至不需要再注射了\N{\rEng}You actually don't even need to shoot up anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}贴在手臂上就可以了\N{\rEng}You just slap it on your arm, you're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们就快研发成功了\N{\rEng}We are so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.12,0:13:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们一直在做试验 目前已经…\N{\rEng}We've been running trials, and we're at…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.66,0:13:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 什么？已经能持续两周？   - 两周\N{\rEng}- What? Two weeks already?   - Two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.33,0:13:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}已经达到两周了 对\N{\rEng}Two weeks already, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.66,0:13:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 我就不打扰你工作了   - 谢谢 先生\N{\rEng}- I'll let you get back to it.   - Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.71,0:13:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你是如何在这个世界制造它的？\N{\rEng}How did you build it in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.92,0:14:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}那些比较复杂的部件是从其他世界弄来的\N{\rEng}Well, we sourced the trickier components from other worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.42,0:14:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}其余的在“极速科技”的研发部门完成\N{\rEng}Ran the rest through Velocity Tech's R & D.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}能使用吗？\N{\rEng}Is it functional?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.68,0:14:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}算能吧\N{\rEng}Ish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}算能？\N{\rEng}Ish?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.85,0:14:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}主要是电力问题\N{\rEng}Power is the main issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}它太大了 每次只能操作20分钟\N{\rEng}It's so big, it can only run for 20 minutes at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.23,0:14:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}有人可能会被困在另一个世界里\N{\rEng}Someone could get stuck in another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.73,0:14:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好 那这个东西靠什么驱动？\N{\rEng}Okay, so then how are you powering it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.32,0:14:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你不会想知道的\N{\rEng}You don't wanna know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}的确 但显然你得告诉我 所以就…\N{\rEng}I don't, but obviously you have to tell me. So just…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好吧\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 只是用了一丁点核能   - 就一丁点？\N{\rEng}- It's just a skosh nuclear.   - Just a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.70,0:14:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}自适应安全屏障的负载是…\N{\rEng}The adaptive shielding load is--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}初代盒子的90倍\N{\rEng}Ninety-X compared to the OG Box.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.34,0:14:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 对   - 所以你是想用\N{\rEng}- Yeah.   - And so you were trying
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.50,0:14:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}裂变来解决供电问题？\N{\rEng}to solve your power issues with fission?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 怎么？不好吗？   - 天啊 莱\N{\rEng}- What? No good?   - Jesus Christ, Leight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.55,0:14:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}什么？ 怎么了？\N{\rEng}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.89,0:14:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}为什么要做这么大？\N{\rEng}Why did you make it so big?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.18,0:14:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好吧 听着 我知道已经过了一段时间 但你还记得我们\N最初的梦想吧？\N{\rEng}Okay, listen, I know it's been a while but you do remember the\Noriginal dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.44,0:14:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}对吧？\N{\rEng}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.40,0:14:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}在这扇门的背后 有些世界已成功治愈了 仍在我们世界\N肆虐的各种疾病\N{\rEng}Through this door are worlds that have cured diseases that still\Nravage ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这一扇门所通往的世界 有的已经克服了气候变化问题\N{\rEng}Through this door are worlds that have reversed climate change,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.07,0:15:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}有的已经拯救了濒危物种 有的已经摆脱了贫困\N{\rEng}saved species from extinction, crushed poverty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.74,0:15:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这扇门背后的世界 很多已经结束了战争\N{\rEng}Through this door are worlds that have ended war.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.41,0:15:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们将造访这些世界\N{\rEng}And we will visit these worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们会找到最好的技术 最聪明的点子\N{\rEng}We will find the best technology, the brightest ideas
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}然后把它们带回我们的世界\N{\rEng}and we will bring them home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.04,0:15:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}没错\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我被困在里面时 我有足够时间去思考你的愿景\N{\rEng}I had a lot of time to think about your vision when I was trapped\Ninside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.93,0:15:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}是的\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.68,0:15:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}想看看里面吗？\N{\rEng}Wanna look inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 当然想   - 是的\N{\rEng}- Of course I do.   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我一直在想泳池里的那个立方体\N{\rEng}I have been thinking about the cube in the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.94,0:15:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}看来你日子过得挺滋润啊？\N{\rEng}Personal life going that well, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.36,0:15:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}别 给我闭嘴 把你上次给我看的照片拿来\N{\rEng}No, shut up. Can I just see those photos that you showed me last\Ntime?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.15,0:15:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 为什么？   - 对了\N{\rEng}- Why?   - You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}妈妈问我这周末 能不能带她去你家看看孩子们\N{\rEng}Mom asked if I could bring her by your place to see the kids this\Nweekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.91,0:15:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你还没告诉她 你跟肯德拉分开了？\N{\rEng}You haven't told her you and Kendra separated?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.75,0:15:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}德斯什 斯图尔特\N{\rEng}Dessen/Stewart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}看个够吧\N{\rEng}Choke on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}该死的混蛋\N{\rEng}Motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}什么？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.35,0:16:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这是“极速科技”的标志\N{\rEng}That is the Velocity Tech logo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}是莱顿万斯的公司\N{\rEng}Leighton Vance's company.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}对 好厉害\N{\rEng}Yeah. Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.82,0:16:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}电线、金属和…\N{\rEng}Wires and metal and st…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.61,0:16:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}希拉 搞什么鬼？\N{\rEng}What the shit, Sheila?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}说重点\N{\rEng}Skip to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.90,0:16:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}所以 这种先进到还没上市\N{\rEng}So what is highly-advanced, not-yet-available in stores,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.87,0:16:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}带有极速标签的技术\N{\rEng}Velocity-labeled technology doing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}怎么会出现在一所废弃学校里的 某个奇怪立方体上？\N{\rEng}in some weird-ass cube in a fucking abandoned school?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.29,0:16:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不管极速在干什么 这些人都有份参与\N{\rEng}These people are in on whatever Velocity is doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.30,0:16:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}被你发现了\N{\rEng}You figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这些人显然是非常老练的企业间谍\N{\rEng}These people are clearly super sophisticated corporate spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.30,0:16:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}听着 我知道你根本不在乎家族生意\N{\rEng}Look, I know you don't give a shit about the family business,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.47,0:16:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}但极速正在摧毁麦克纳马拉科技\N{\rEng}but Velocity is destroying MacNamara Tech,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.89,0:17:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我得阻止他们 而这些人就是关键线索\N{\rEng}and I need to stop them and these people are the link.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.15,0:17:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}所以 拜托你 前面再附上一句“去你的” 帮帮我\N{\rEng}So, pretty please with a go fuck yourself on top, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.71,0:17:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}说真的 为什么要做到这种规模？\N{\rEng}Seriously, why build to this scale?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我去过一个叫XC-89的世界 那里几乎被污染到极限\N了\N{\rEng}I went to this world, XC-89, that had been polluted within an\Ninch of its life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.09,0:17:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}二氧化碳浓度飙到了百万分之七百\N{\rEng}Carbon levels spiked to 700 ppm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.97,0:17:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 天啊   - 是的\N{\rEng}- Jesus.   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.01,0:17:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他们的科学家能够制造出碳洗涤器\N{\rEng}Their scientists were able to build carbon scrubbers
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.81,0:17:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}每天可以过滤80公吨的大气层\N{\rEng}that could filter 80 metric tons of the atmosphere a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.77,0:17:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}将他们的星球从危机边缘拯救回来\N{\rEng}Pulled their planet right back from the brink.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.19,0:17:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我把那些方案带到了很多的灾难世界\N{\rEng}I brought those plans to many hurting worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.57,0:17:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}但其中某些世界 得花上好几年的时间才能制造出来\N{\rEng}But it'll take years, in some cases, to build them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.92,0:18:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}天啊\N{\rEng}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}是啊\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.80,0:18:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这里大到能让一辆半挂卡车直接开过去\N{\rEng}You could drive a semitruck through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.01,0:18:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}没错\N{\rEng}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}或是容纳小型军队\N{\rEng}Or a small army.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.47,0:18:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}或是收留快灭亡星球的难民们\N{\rEng}Or refugees from a dying planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.56,0:18:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}对 这肯定\N{\rEng}Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.65,0:18:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}有人使用过这条走廊吗？\N{\rEng}And has anyone traveled in this Corridor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.65,0:18:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}没有 没人使用过\N{\rEng}No. No one has.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.53,0:18:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}太危险了\N{\rEng}It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.53,0:18:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}尤其是它的电力问题\N{\rEng}Especially with the power issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}但是 当我们启动它时\N{\rEng}But when we fired it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这里面会短暂地建立一个叠加状态\N{\rEng}a superpositional state was briefly established inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.04,0:18:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你们不用量子处理器\N{\rEng}And you're not using quantum processors
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}来调控自适应安全屏障？\N{\rEng}to manage the adaptive shielding?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.05,0:18:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我猜你们面对的问题 不是原始能力 而是处理能力吧？\N{\rEng}And I'm guessing your issue isn't raw power so much as processing\Npower?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你起得真早\N{\rEng}You're up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.66,0:19:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}昨晚…\N{\rEng}Last night…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.37,0:19:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我梦到我向你妈妈求婚的那天\N{\rEng}I dreamt about the day I asked your mother to marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.88,0:19:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我问她我能不能成为你的爸爸\N{\rEng}I asked her if I could be your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.92,0:19:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}结果我就成了她的丈夫\N{\rEng}And I became her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.63,0:19:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}在她的余生中 我爱她、尊敬她、珍惜她\N{\rEng}I loved, honored and cherished her for the rest of her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.64,0:19:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}当你成为我女儿时…\N{\rEng}When I became your father…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.98,0:19:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我承诺过会保护你的\N{\rEng}I promised to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.11,0:19:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不 爸\N{\rEng}No, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.99,0:19:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你我当时都不在同一个世界\N{\rEng}You weren't even in the same world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.91,0:20:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你也许不是我的丹妮拉\N{\rEng}You may not be my Daniela,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.45,0:20:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}但当我看着你时 我看到了我的女儿\N{\rEng}but when I look at you, I see my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.54,0:20:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我明白你的意思\N{\rEng}I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.14,0:20:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}糟了\N{\rEng}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.16,0:21:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}谢谢\N{\rEng}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.80,0:21:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嘿 我在想…\N{\rEng}Hey. I was wondering…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.51,0:21:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}今天是查理的生日\N{\rEng}Well, you know, it's Charlie's birthday today
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.26,0:21:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我打算给他打电话\N{\rEng}and I was gonna call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.47,0:21:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你想跟他打个招呼吗？\N{\rEng}Would you want to say hi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.68,0:21:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}只要你觉得他不会不开心就行\N{\rEng}If you don't think it would upset him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.35,0:21:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他从来没见过你\N{\rEng}Well, he's never known you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.19,0:21:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我想他会开心的\N{\rEng}I think he'd like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.57,0:21:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不会很奇怪吗？\N{\rEng}It wouldn't be weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.11,0:22:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}现在来说 什么都不算奇怪了\N{\rEng}At this point, nothing is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.20,0:22:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好吧\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.25,0:22:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}喂？\N{\rEng}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.33,0:22:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 喂 爱德华多 我是查理的妈妈\N- 喂 斯图尔特太太\N{\rEng}- Hey, Eduardo, it's Charlie's mom.   - Hey, Mrs. Stewart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.75,0:22:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嗨 他在吗？\N{\rEng}Hi, is he there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.76,0:22:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不在 他昨天离开了\N{\rEng}No, he left yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.72,0:22:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他去哪儿了？\N{\rEng}Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.55,0:22:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我不想给他惹麻烦\N{\rEng}I don't want to get him in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.60,0:22:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不 没关系 你不会给他惹麻烦的\N{\rEng}No, that's okay. You won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.52,0:22:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他只说了他要出城几天\N{\rEng}I mean, he just said he was going to be out of town for a few\Ndays
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.89,0:22:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}去拜访一个朋友\N{\rEng}to visit a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.69,0:22:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}哪个朋友？\N{\rEng}Which friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.06,0:22:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}一个叫马克斯的\N{\rEng}Someone named Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.61,0:22:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}斯图尔特太太？\N{\rEng}Mrs. Stewart?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.49,0:22:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好的 谢谢你 爱德华多\N{\rEng}Yeah, thanks, Eduardo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.99,0:22:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你能告诉他我打来过吗？\N{\rEng}Will you tell him that I called?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.50,0:22:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好的 行 没问题\N{\rEng}Yeah. Yeah, sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.42,0:22:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}没什么事吧？\N{\rEng}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.06,0:23:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你刚来到这里？\N{\rEng}Did you just come through?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.69,0:23:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}等等 你是查理？\N{\rEng}Wait. Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.45,0:23:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}查理\N{\rEng}Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.49,0:23:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你怎么知道我的名字？\N{\rEng}How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.45,0:23:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我没恶意\N{\rEng}You're not in any danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.62,0:23:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我是…劳雷尔\N{\rEng}I'm… I'm Laurel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.29,0:23:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}抱歉 我有点激动 我…还是第一次遇见叫查理的人\N{\rEng}I'm sorry, I'm a little excited. I've… I've never met a Charlie\Nbefore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.21,0:23:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你穿行很久了吗？\N{\rEng}You've been traveling long?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.18,0:23:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}大概一天了\N{\rEng}About a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.47,0:23:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}身上还有其他伤吗？\N{\rEng}Any other injuries?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.77,0:23:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}发生什么了？\N{\rEng}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.40,0:23:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}被树枝打到\N{\rEng}Branch hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.32,0:24:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我当时在一座森林里\N{\rEng}I was in a forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.57,0:24:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}很暗\N{\rEng}It was dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.65,0:24:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}有东西在追我\N{\rEng}Something was chasing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.78,0:24:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}很高兴你成功来到这里\N{\rEng}I'm glad you made it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.67,0:24:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这是什么地方？\N{\rEng}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.34,0:24:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我的家\N{\rEng}My home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.63,0:24:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}几年前 我在楼上睡着觉\N{\rEng}I was sleeping upstairs a couple of years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.26,0:24:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}后来我听见一声像爆炸一样的巨响\N{\rEng}and when I heard what sounded like an explosion
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.64,0:24:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}震得整栋房子都在摇晃\N{\rEng}that shook the bones of the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.89,0:24:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我跑下楼 发现了三个擅闯者\N{\rEng}I ran downstairs to find three intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.56,0:24:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}那个盒子\N{\rEng}The box,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.06,0:24:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}一个叫杰森德斯什的男人 和一个叫阿曼达卢卡斯的女人\N{\rEng}a man named Jason Dessen, and a woman named Amanda Lucas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.82,0:24:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你见过…\N{\rEng}You've…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.91,0:24:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我爸爸？\N{\rEng}You've met my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.62,0:24:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}其中一个版本\N{\rEng}A version.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.87,0:25:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你不介意家里放着这个盒子？\N{\rEng}And you're just cool with the box being in your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.34,0:25:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}可以这么说吧\N{\rEng}Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.93,0:25:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你饿吗？\N{\rEng}Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.43,0:25:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}很累？\N{\rEng}Tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.18,0:25:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}对 非常累\N{\rEng}Yeah, very tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.15,0:25:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你可以在这里睡几个小时\N{\rEng}You're welcome to sleep here for a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.86,0:25:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我楼上有一间客房 但大多数人都…\N{\rEng}I have a guest room upstairs, but a lot of people stay…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.40,0:25:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不想离盒子太远\N{\rEng}stay near the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.95,0:25:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这张…\N{\rEng}This…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.74,0:25:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}沙发可以伸展\N{\rEng}this couch pulls out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.78,0:26:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}喂 这里是斯图尔特家\N{\rEng}Hey, you've reached the Stewarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.91,0:26:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们现在无法接听电话 请留言\N{\rEng}We can't come to the phone right now, so leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.87,0:26:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}杰森 你在吗？\N{\rEng}Jason, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.08,0:26:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}如果你在 请接电话\N{\rEng}If you're there, pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.71,0:26:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我刚给查理打了电话 爱德华多说他打从昨天\N{\rEng}I just called Charlie, and Eduardo said he's been gone
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.21,0:26:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}就离开了 他去见马克斯了\N{\rEng}since yesterday, that he went to see Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.43,0:26:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我现在在我爸家 不过我要回去了\N{\rEng}I'm at my dad's now, but I'm gonna head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.51,0:26:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我几小时后应该就到了\N{\rEng}I should be there in a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.01,0:26:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我在想也许你见过他\N{\rEng}I'm hoping maybe you've seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.81,0:26:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好了 我爱你\N{\rEng}Okay, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.92,0:27:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嘿 一有消息就给我打电话\N{\rEng}Hey, call me when you know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.25,0:27:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我会的…\N{\rEng}I will…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.84,0:27:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 我还穿着你的外套   - 不 留着吧\N{\rEng}- I'm still wearing your jacket.   - No, keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.93,0:27:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我不知道该说什么\N{\rEng}I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.52,0:27:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}人生中最重要的一天 就是遇见自己的那一天\N{\rEng}You know, the most important day of your life is the day you meet\Nyourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.52,0:27:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}当你遇见自己时\N{\rEng}And when you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.07,0:27:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你会遇见我一直以来见到的那个人\N{\rEng}you're going to encounter the same person I've always seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.78,0:27:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}她是我见过最勇敢、最善良、最美丽的人\N{\rEng}The bravest, kindest, most beautiful soul I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.70,0:27:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}认识这个版本的你 是件最美好的事\N{\rEng}Knowing you, this version, has been a perfect thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.85,0:28:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}如果你需要我 随时找我\N{\rEng}If you ever need me, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.19,0:28:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好了 去找你儿子吧\N{\rEng}Now, go find your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.41,0:28:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嗨 我马上就来\N{\rEng}Hey, I'll be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.27,0:28:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嗨\N{\rEng}Hey. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.32,0:28:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嘿 你是上次帮我…做那件事的私家侦探\N{\rEng}Hey, you're the PI that I… you know, helped me with the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.24,0:28:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 没错 米切尔麦克纳马拉   - 对\N{\rEng}- That's right. Mitchel MacNamara.   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.62,0:29:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 杰森对吧？   - 对 天啊\N{\rEng}- Jason?   - Yeah, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.49,0:29:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 很高兴见到你   - 我也是\N{\rEng}- Good to see ya.   - You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.25,0:29:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}想喝点什么？\N{\rEng}What can I get you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.17,0:29:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你们最好的黑麦威士忌\N{\rEng}Your finest rye.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.84,0:29:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 加冰块还是…   - 纯的\N{\rEng}- Rocks or…   - Neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.17,0:29:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}纯的\N{\rEng}Neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.63,0:29:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你和家人安顿好了吗？\N{\rEng}You and the family settling in okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.93,0:29:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好了…\N{\rEng}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.01,0:29:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}其实我们就住在洛根广场附近\N{\rEng}Actually, we got a place close by in Logan Square,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.06,0:29:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我在这里上班 我儿子在读大学\N{\rEng}and I work here and my son's in college.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.36,0:29:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 天啊   - 是的\N{\rEng}- Wow.   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.86,0:29:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他读哪一科？\N{\rEng}What's he studying?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.07,0:29:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}建筑学\N{\rEng}Architecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.15,0:29:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 很好啊   - 是啊\N{\rEng}- That's great.   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.28,0:29:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嘿 没什么顾客 我请你喝一杯？\N{\rEng}Hey, it's quiet. I'll buy you a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.28,0:29:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}听着 我…很想 但我得在欢乐时光人潮到来前\N{\rEng}Look, I'd… I'd like to, but I got a lot of prep to finish
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.87,0:29:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}做很多准备工作 不过还是谢谢你\N{\rEng}before the happy hour rush, but thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.01,0:30:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}对 待会儿这里会忙得不可开交\N{\rEng}Yeah, it's about to get a little crazy in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.89,0:30:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}再来一杯？\N{\rEng}Another?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.81,0:30:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}那玩意儿有什么功能？\N{\rEng}What does it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.40,0:30:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}什么玩意儿？\N{\rEng}What does what do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.48,0:30:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你的那个立方体\N{\rEng}Your cube.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.49,0:30:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你说什么？\N{\rEng}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.13,0:30:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}瞧\N{\rEng}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.55,0:30:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}听着 如果不想我把收集到的信息说出去\N{\rEng}Look, if you want the information I have to stay between us,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.05,0:30:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你就得让我知道这是怎么回事\N{\rEng}I got to know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.22,0:30:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}什么信息？\N{\rEng}What information?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.89,0:30:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}旧金山的这几个人看起来很眼熟\N{\rEng}These people in San Francisco, they look very familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.94,0:31:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我要请你马上离开 给我看看\N{\rEng}I'm gonna ask you to leave right now. Let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.86,0:31:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}它有什么功能？\N{\rEng}What does it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.03,0:31:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}听着 要么你自己离开 要么我叫人把你拖出去…\N{\rEng}Listen, you walk out or I get someone to drag you--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.33,0:31:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你和你的家人好不容易在这里安定下来了\N{\rEng}You and your family are finally getting your footing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.95,0:31:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你老板知不知道你是冒牌杰森斯图尔特？\N{\rEng}Does your boss know you're not really Jason Stewart?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.62,0:31:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}查理的学校知道吗？\N{\rEng}Does Charlie's school know?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.96,0:31:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我不是想搞砸你的生活 但也许我们可以帮彼此一把\N{\rEng}I'm not trying to mess up your life, but maybe we can help each\Nother out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.21,0:31:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}杰 没什么事吧？\N{\rEng}All good, Jay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.80,0:31:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 别这样   - 杰森？\N{\rEng}- Don't do this.   - Jason?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.17,0:31:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}对…没事\N{\rEng}Yeah, yeah, it's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.05,0:31:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}再给我来一杯吧\N{\rEng}I'll have another.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.35,0:31:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好吧\N{\rEng}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.56,0:31:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不如这样？\N{\rEng}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.65,0:31:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我跟你喝一杯\N{\rEng}I will join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.32,0:31:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}有何不可？\N{\rEng}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.35,0:32:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我不想再惹麻烦了\N{\rEng}I don't want any more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.10,0:32:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}为什么这么说？\N{\rEng}Why would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.52,0:32:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}如果我给你看 你能保证 永远不再来打扰我和我的家人\N吗？\N{\rEng}If I show you, you'll leave me and my family alone forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.90,0:32:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我保证\N{\rEng}I give you my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.74,0:32:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.07,0:32:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}等我一下\N{\rEng}Just give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.74,0:32:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 嘿 马特   - 是的\N{\rEng}- Hey, Matt.   - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.45,0:32:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 我能不能…   - 什么？\N{\rEng}- Can I--   - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.49,0:32:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}听着 有个不情之请\N{\rEng}Listen, I hate to do this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.08,0:32:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}怎么了？\N{\rEng}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.16,0:32:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我得提早走\N{\rEng}I need to take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.92,0:32:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}没什么事吧？\N{\rEng}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.08,0:32:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}家里有急事\N{\rEng}It's a family emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.30,0:32:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}去处理你的急事吧\N{\rEng}Go do what you gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.88,0:32:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.39,0:32:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好吧\N{\rEng}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.27,0:33:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你确定要这么做吗？\N{\rEng}Are you sure that you want to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.98,0:33:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我必须这么做\N{\rEng}I have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.45,0:33:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}那好 干杯\N{\rEng}Well, salud.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.13,0:33:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我去拿我的东西\N{\rEng}I will get my things.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.06,0:33:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你哪来的钱建这实验室？\N{\rEng}How did you pay for all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.52,0:33:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这个世界里的我原来混得一塌糊涂\N{\rEng}So, it turns out my counterpart in this world is a bit of a\Nfuck-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.65,0:33:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}没错\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.86,0:33:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}把极速都快经营垮了\N{\rEng}Running Velocity into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.91,0:33:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}所以我就接手了\N{\rEng}So, I took over.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.49,0:33:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}从其他世界找来了一些高端科技设备\N{\rEng}Brought some technological wonders from other worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.91,0:33:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}极速现在总算配得上它该有的地位 一家首屈一指的科技\N公司\N{\rEng}Now, Velocity is the premier tech company that it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.08,0:34:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 好的 你好   - 我知道 谢谢\N{\rEng}- Okay. Hello.   - I know. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.09,0:34:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}对 我们都来自同一个世界\N{\rEng}Yeah, we're all from the same world.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.89,0:34:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}布莱尔\N{\rEng}Blair.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.23,0:34:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嗨\N{\rEng}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.23,0:34:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嗨\N{\rEng}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.90,0:34:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}天啊\N{\rEng}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.27,0:34:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你怎么会在这里？\N{\rEng}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.57,0:34:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我在帮这家伙打造更多更美好的世界\N{\rEng}I'm trying to help this guy make better worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.00,0:34:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}那么 我们去吃饭吧？\N{\rEng}So, shall we eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.88,0:34:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好的　好\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.51,0:34:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你进去过那盒子吗？\N{\rEng}Have you ever been inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.39,0:35:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我听过很多故事 知道那走廊不适合我这样的人\N{\rEng}Heard enough stories to know that the Corridor's no place for\Nsomeone like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.27,0:35:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}但我非常好奇\N{\rEng}But I am very curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.07,0:35:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}还要吃点什么吗？\N{\rEng}Can I get you anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.78,0:35:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不用了 谢谢\N{\rEng}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.91,0:35:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}但我可能该走了\N{\rEng}But I should probably get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.45,0:35:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不…你可是我的客人\N{\rEng}No, no, no, no, you're my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.54,0:35:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}想问问你为何会…\N{\rEng}Can I ask you why…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.71,0:35:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}一个人在盒子里？\N{\rEng}you're in the box alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.55,0:35:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你知道我爸之前发生的事 对吧？\N{\rEng}You know what happened to my father, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.72,0:35:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他被另一版本的自己绑架了 那人想抢走他的人生\N{\rEng}He was kidnapped by a version of himself and tried to take over\Nhis life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.60,0:35:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}对\N{\rEng}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.22,0:35:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}在你的那个世界 他成功回来了吗？\N{\rEng}In your world, did he ever make it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.60,0:35:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他回来了\N{\rEng}He did.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.19,0:35:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}出现的还有一堆其他版本的他\N{\rEng}Along with a bunch of other versions of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.61,0:35:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}杰森\N{\rEng}Jason!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.08,0:36:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}杰\N{\rEng}Jay!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.38,0:36:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这里是乡村酒吧\N{\rEng}Village Tap.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.72,0:36:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}喂 我是丹妮拉\N{\rEng}Hi, it's Daniela.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.22,0:36:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}杰森在吗？\N{\rEng}Is Jason there?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.81,0:36:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不在 他几小时前离开了\N{\rEng}No, he took off a couple of hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.98,0:36:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他说他家里有急事\N{\rEng}He said he had a family emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.52,0:36:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好的 如果他回来\N{\rEng}Okay, if he comes back,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.23,0:36:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}麻烦你转告他我打来过 而且现在在家里 行吗？\N{\rEng}will you tell him that I called and I'm at the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.36,0:36:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 没问题 明白   - 好 谢谢 再见\N{\rEng}- Sure thing. You got it.   - Okay, thanks. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.60,0:37:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}今天是我们的生日\N{\rEng}Today's our birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.69,0:37:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我和马克斯的生日\N{\rEng}Mine and Max's.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.65,0:37:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}生日快乐\N{\rEng}Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.82,0:37:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}谢谢\N{\rEng}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.91,0:37:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}几天前 我的…\N{\rEng}A couple of days ago, my…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.45,0:37:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}爸爸说他去过一个马克斯还活着的世界\N{\rEng}my dad said he saw a world where Max was still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.38,0:37:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}所以你想见见他\N{\rEng}And you want to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.26,0:37:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这是你第一次单独进入盒子\N{\rEng}This is your first time alone in the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.80,0:37:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}每个人 包括你自己 都说过这盒子有多可怕\N{\rEng}Everyone, including yourself, has told me how scary a place it\Ncan be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.06,0:37:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}而你脑子里那些纷乱的思绪也有害无益\N{\rEng}And all that stuff swirling around in your head isn't helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.81,0:37:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我该怎么办？\N{\rEng}What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.78,0:38:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我有个主意\N{\rEng}I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.08,0:38:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不介意我失陪一下？\N{\rEng}Would you excuse me for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.29,0:38:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}说真的 这很完美 对吧？\N{\rEng}Seriously, it's kind of perfect, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.71,0:38:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这个世界…\N{\rEng}This world is…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.26,0:38:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}没被破坏 是个真实的世界\N{\rEng}it's not spoiled, it's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.51,0:38:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}什么意思？\N{\rEng}And what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.10,0:38:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这里不会到处都是屏幕 对吧？\N{\rEng}Well, there aren't screens everywhere, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.51,0:38:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}人们会有眼神交流 会互相交谈\N{\rEng}People actually look at each other, talk to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.52,0:38:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}可你这不是要把手机引入市场吗？\N{\rEng}Well, you are bringing a cell phone to market.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.19,0:38:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}她这话让你无从反驳啊 朋友\N{\rEng}She's got you there, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.65,0:38:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 什么？不…不是…   - 嘿\N{\rEng}- What? No. No, no, no. That's not--   - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.65,0:38:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好的 抱歉\N{\rEng}Okay. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.53,0:38:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}失陪一下\N{\rEng}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.75,0:38:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}那个…\N{\rEng}It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.04,0:38:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}见到你真好\N{\rEng}It's really good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.93,0:39:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你在那个盒子里都干些什么呀？\N{\rEng}What do you get up to in the box?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.93,0:39:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}就努力让自己活着\N{\rEng}You know, just try to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.18,0:39:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}估计跟你一样吧\N{\rEng}Just like you, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.36,0:39:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我见到他了\N{\rEng}I met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.48,0:39:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}被你抢走人生的那个杰森\N{\rEng}The Jason whose life you stole.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.78,0:39:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 是的   - 对 他和阿曼达在一起\N{\rEng}- Yeah.   - Yeah, he was with Amanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.95,0:39:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}那个被你丢下不管的阿曼达\N{\rEng}The Amanda you up and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.54,0:39:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}是的\N{\rEng}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.42,0:39:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他们在极速的机库里找到了我 我当时住在里面\N{\rEng}They found me in a Velocity hangar, and I was living in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.30,0:39:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他们把一切都告诉了我\N{\rEng}And they told me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.38,0:39:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我并不以那些事为荣…\N{\rEng}You know, I'm not proud of the things--
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.84,0:39:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}那我就放心了 杰森 因为…\N{\rEng}Well, that's a fucking relief, Jason, because…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.31,0:39:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你干的事听起来很可怕\N{\rEng}it sounded pretty horrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.02,0:39:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你知道吗？\N{\rEng}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.94,0:39:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你为什么来这里？\N{\rEng}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.65,0:40:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}因为我不想…\N{\rEng}Because I would…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.94,0:40:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}照镜子时 讨厌镜子里的那个人\N{\rEng}I would like to look at myself in the mirror and not hate what I\Nsee.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.41,0:40:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}那就去救济站当志愿者吧\N{\rEng}Then volunteer at a soup kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.38,0:40:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嘿 不好意思啊\N{\rEng}Hey, I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.30,0:40:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}对了 你…\N{\rEng}So, you…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.09,0:40:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你告诉他你对电力问题的看法了吗？\N{\rEng}You tell him about your read on the power issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.22,0:40:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}对 她或许有解决方案\N{\rEng}Yeah, she might have a fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.72,0:40:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好吧 听着 我本来打算晚点再讨论这事的\N{\rEng}Okay, listen, I wasn't gonna do this till later,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.10,0:40:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}但不管了\N{\rEng}but fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.56,0:40:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们一开始很顺利 对吧？\N{\rEng}We started strong, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.86,0:40:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}中间虽有些波折 但结尾肯定会特别精彩\N{\rEng}The middle, a little shaky, but the end is about to be\Nspectacular.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.03,0:40:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}怎么回事？莱顿 你在做什么？\N{\rEng}What is happening? What are you doing right now, Leighton?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.41,0:40:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}布莱尔 我们三个 一起建造了一样了不起的东西\N{\rEng}Blair, the three of us built some amazing shit together,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.41,0:40:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}现在又聚在一起了\N{\rEng}and here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.16,0:40:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们三个又碰头了 对吧？\N{\rEng}We found each other again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.00,0:40:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这就是天意\N{\rEng}It's fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.12,0:40:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 莱顿   - 回来吧 好吗？\N{\rEng}- Leighton.   - Come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.17,0:41:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}回家来 让我好好利用你这聪明的大脑\N{\rEng}Come home and let me put that brilliant mind of yours to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.38,0:41:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们可以把这项事业做到底\N{\rEng}We can finish what we started.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.42,0:41:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嘿\N{\rEng}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.51,0:41:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}别说了\N{\rEng}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.22,0:41:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}怎么了？\N{\rEng}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.77,0:41:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}所以 一开始 我很幸运\N{\rEng}So, at first, I was pretty lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.15,0:41:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好吧 我…\N{\rEng}Okay. I…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.98,0:41:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}当时带着满满的正能量进入那个盒子\N{\rEng}went into the box with so much positive energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.06,0:42:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}也有恐惧\N{\rEng}And fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.86,0:42:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我当时也带有恐惧\N{\rEng}I had fear too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.35,0:42:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}在那之后\N{\rEng}And so, after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.23,0:42:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我去的每一个世界都比上一个更糟\N{\rEng}every world that I went to was worse than the one before it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.69,0:42:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}所以 我越生气、越害怕\N{\rEng}And so the more angry and scared I became,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.15,0:42:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}就越危险 直到…\N{\rEng}the more dangerous until…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.78,0:42:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}天啊\N{\rEng}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.12,0:42:59.54,TopDefault,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,32)}搞什么？\N{\rTopEng}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.12,0:43:03.67,TopDefault,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,32)}停止\N{\rTopEng}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.67,0:43:05.29,TopDefault,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,32)}我害死了一个世界\N{\rTopEng}I killed a whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.42,0:43:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}天啊\N{\rEng}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.51,0:43:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 不…你并没有   - 死了数十亿人\N{\rEng}- No, no, you didn't.   - Billions of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.43,0:43:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不是你\N{\rEng}It wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.97,0:43:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}而这死亡人数还只是人类\N{\rEng}And that's just the human toll.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.22,0:43:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 这不是你的错   - 是我的错…\N{\rEng}- You're not to blame for any of that.   - Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.89,0:43:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}是我的错\N{\rEng}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.10,0:43:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}因为盒子是我造的\N{\rEng}Because I built the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.81,0:43:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}是我使用了它\N{\rEng}I used the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.52,0:43:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}坏事的确发生过\N{\rEng}Bad things have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.40,0:43:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这点不容争辩\N{\rEng}There's no argument there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.70,0:43:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}未来或许还会重演\N{\rEng}And they may even happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.41,0:43:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}可我也去过不少世界 那盒子让那些世界不用陷入黑暗\N{\rEng}But I have been to worlds that would have gone dark if it wasn't\Nfor the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.78,0:43:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好吧 我们还是可以做好事的\N{\rEng}Okay, we can still do some good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.08,0:43:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好 我们…可以制定出指导方针 对吧？\N{\rEng}Okay, we'll… We'll come up with guidelines, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.50,0:43:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 使用程序、安全措施 布莱尔\N- 那盒子就是个灾难\N{\rEng}- Procedures, safety measures. Blair.   - The box is a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.29,0:43:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}抱歉 确实如此\N{\rEng}I'm sorry, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.71,0:43:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 所以 你就造了一个更大的盒子？\N- 你能不能…\N{\rEng}- So, then you build a bigger one?   - Can you just…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.05,0:43:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你疯了吗？\N{\rEng}Are you out of your fucking mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.72,0:43:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}布莱尔\N{\rEng}Blair.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.01,0:43:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这是一股无法控制、无法阻止的力量\N{\rEng}This is an uncontrollable, unstoppable force.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.76,0:44:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 拜托你   - 别说了\N{\rEng}- Just please.   - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.14,0:44:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}别再说了\N{\rEng}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.19,0:44:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}因为如果你以为自己 能应付这件事引发的非预期后果…\N{\rEng}Because if you think that you can manage the unintended\Nconsequences of this shit…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.41,0:44:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}那你就错了\N{\rEng}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.85,0:44:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好了 跟我说说\N{\rEng}All right, lay it on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.98,0:44:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}美国另一头竟然有个 跟你们一模一样的家庭 这怎么可\N能？\N{\rEng}How is there another family across the country that looks exactly\Nlike yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.02,0:44:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}为什么人一走进这玩意儿就消失了？\N{\rEng}Why do people walk into this thing and disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.02,0:44:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你跟极速之间是什么关系？\N{\rEng}And how are you connected with Velocity?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.86,0:44:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我的侦探能力非常强\N{\rEng}I'm really good at my job,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.99,0:45:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}可我连个头绪都没有\N{\rEng}but I can't even begin to put the pieces of this puzzle together
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.45,0:45:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}怎么也拼凑不出一个合理的解释\N{\rEng}in a way that makes any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.75,0:45:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这玩意儿我彻底检查过了 里外都翻了个遍\N{\rEng}I've been all over this thing. Inside, out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.75,0:45:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}可我连一点能表明它用途的迹象都没发现\N{\rEng}I can't find something that even hints at what it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.17,0:45:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}听我说\N{\rEng}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.59,0:45:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我知道这一切像个谜团 让人难以理解\N{\rEng}I know this is all very confusing and mysterious,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.59,0:45:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}但如果我是你 我会立刻头也不回地离开\N{\rEng}but if I were you, I would just walk away and not look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.39,0:45:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}有些事 一旦知道了 就再也回不到从前\N{\rEng}Once you know, you can't unknow.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.73,0:45:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}拜托 兄弟 相信我一次 去好好过你自己的人生吧\N{\rEng}Please, man, just trust me, go fucking live your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.15,0:45:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}别在追查这个盒子了\N{\rEng}Forget about the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.19,0:45:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}也别管我了\N{\rEng}Forget about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.28,0:45:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}天啊 看来你是认真的\N{\rEng}Wow, I think you actually mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.82,0:45:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你根本不晓得我有多认真\N{\rEng}Like you don't even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.83,0:45:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}听着 我不想威胁你 或你的家人 但我必须知道…\N{\rEng}Look, I don't want to threaten you or your family, but I need to\Nknow--
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.46,0:45:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}行\N{\rEng}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.58,0:45:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你必须知道\N{\rEng}You need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.13,0:46:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我直接带你去看比较容易\N{\rEng}I think it's easier if I just show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.98,0:46:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们要进这盒子？\N{\rEng}We going in?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.69,0:46:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}来吧\N{\rEng}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.07,0:46:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}就在后面那边\N{\rEng}Now, right up the back…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.11,0:46:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这里吗？\N{\rEng}Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.20,0:46:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}下面有个面板\N{\rEng}There's a panel, down low.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.87,0:46:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你得按下它\N{\rEng}And you need to press it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.87,0:46:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}就按进去？\N{\rEng}Does it press in?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.92,0:46:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嘿\N{\rEng}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.22,0:46:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我警告过你了\N{\rEng}I did warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.05,0:46:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}别 嘿\N{\rEng}Hey. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.80,0:46:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嘿\N{\rEng}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.10,0:46:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嘿 别闹了\N{\rEng}Hey, knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.07,0:47:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嘿\N{\rEng}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.55,0:48:08.26,TopDefault,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,32)}（布莱尔二号、布莱尔一号 瑞安二号、瑞安一号）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.26,0:48:09.85,TopDefault,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,32)}（阿曼达二号、阿曼达一号）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.85,0:48:12.64,TopDefault,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,32)}（杰森五号、杰森四号 杰森三号、杰森二号、杰森一号\N）
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.78,0:48:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我一直觉得挺神奇的 你们每个人的故事都如此紧密相连\N{\rEng}I've been struck how interconnected everyone's stories are.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.99,0:48:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}其中一个杰森提出了一个集体纠缠理论 认为是它把你们\N所有人给联系在一起\N{\rEng}One Jason theorizes that you're all being pulled together by\Ncommunal entanglement.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.08,0:48:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不是所有人都能娴熟驾驭那盒子\N{\rEng}Not everyone's adept at navigating the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.42,0:48:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}但那些参透其道者都一致认为\N{\rEng}But the ones who figure it out all say the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.76,0:48:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}要去到你想去的地方 你就得想起点什么\N{\rEng}To get to where you wanna go, you need to remember something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.22,0:48:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}最好是想起一个人\N{\rEng}Ideally a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.06,0:48:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}马克斯死的时候我才四岁\N{\rEng}I mean, I was four when Max died.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.48,0:49:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你对他可还有任何记忆？\N{\rEng}Do you have any memories of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.70,0:49:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我记得他躺在医院的病床上 浑身插满管子\N{\rEng}I remember him in a hospital bed, hooked up to a bunch of tubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.09,0:49:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我妈有一些我们小时候的录像\N{\rEng}My mom has these videos of us when we were younger…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.26,0:49:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我最爱看的一段\N{\rEng}My favorite is this one of my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.64,0:49:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}是我爸在扫一整大堆的落叶\N{\rEng}He's raking this huge pile of leaves
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.85,0:49:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他不停地把叶子往我们俩身边推\N{\rEng}and he just keeps pushing them all around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.48,0:49:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}看着那堆叶子越堆越高、越堆越大\N{\rEng}And the two of us are just laughing and laughing
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.03,0:49:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们俩就一直笑个不停\N{\rEng}as the pile gets bigger and bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.41,0:49:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我觉得这段回忆 或许能带你去你想去的地方\N{\rEng}I suspect that might just take you where you wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.14,0:50:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}没事的\N{\rEng}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.81,0:50:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不管了\N{\rEng}Fuck this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.66,0:50:40.25,TopDefault,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,32)}（杰森 我不知道你在哪里）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.25,0:50:44.71,TopDefault,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,32)}（我想查理应该是 进去盒子里找马克斯了）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.71,0:50:48.51,TopDefault,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,32)}（我去找他 我爱你 亲 丹妮拉）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.36,0:51:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他们这次又做了什么？\N{\rEng}What did they do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.07,0:51:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他们抽了骨髓\N{\rEng}They took bone marrow this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.78,0:51:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}还在找那个根本不可能找到的抗原\N{\rEng}Still looking for antigens that they're not gonna fucking find.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.87,0:51:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 该死   - 你还好吗？\N{\rEng}- Fuck.   - Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.92,0:51:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}谢谢\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.42,0:51:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嘿…\N{\rEng}Hey…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.75,0:51:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}谢天谢地\N{\rEng}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.25,0:51:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我是莱顿万斯医生 他们今天派我来与二位谈话\N{\rEng}I'm Dr. Leighton Vance, and I've been asked to speak with the\Nboth of you today
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.34,0:51:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}因为我公司有份参与调查　希卡阿夸公园的立方体\N{\rEng}because of my company's involvement
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.01,0:51:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}因为我公司有份参与调查　希卡阿夸公园的立方体\N{\rEng}with investigating the Shikaakwa Park cube.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.60,0:51:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}如你们所知 之前大家一直抱有希望\N{\rEng}Now, as you know, there was hope
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.60,0:51:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}因为你们两人都从黑鸢尾瘟疫中 以某种方式恢复了青春\N活力\N{\rEng}that since you both were able to somehow rejuvenate
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.44,0:51:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}或许你们体内藏着研发疫苗的\N{\rEng}from the Black Iris plague, your bodies may contain the road map
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.44,0:51:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 关键线索   - 你知道他们…\N{\rEng}- to developing a vaccine.   - You know they--
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.36,0:51:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}很可惜 检测结果一无所获\N{\rEng}Unfortunately, their testing came up empty,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.20,0:51:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}现在 所有注意力 都转移到了那个立方体上\N{\rEng}and all attention has been turned to the cube.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.36,0:51:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}希望是它治愈了你们\N{\rEng}They're hoping it's what somehow cured you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.41,0:52:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们已经拆了移至千禧公园的那个盒子\N{\rEng}We already dismantled the one that was moved to Millennium Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.87,0:52:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}该死\N{\rEng}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.33,0:52:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}黑鸢尾瘟疫正在全球蔓延\N{\rEng}The Black Iris plague is spreading around the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.67,0:52:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}北美五大湖已经同意　配合国际要求 共享所有关键数据\N{\rEng}and the United Great Lakes has agreed to cooperate
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.67,0:52:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}北美五大湖已经同意　配合国际要求 共享所有关键数据\N{\rEng}with the international requests to share all critical data.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.92,0:52:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这包括立方体 和关于你们俩的所有已知信息\N{\rEng}Which includes the cube and all known information about the both\Nof you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.80,0:52:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 什么信息？   - 搞什么？\N{\rEng}- What information?   - What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.09,0:52:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}州联盟的代表半小时后会来接走你们\N{\rEng}Representatives from the state union will be here to collect you\Nboth in 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.02,0:52:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}他们的调查方式将会更加激进\N{\rEng}Their methods of inquiry will become considerably more intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.44,0:52:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我给你们俩带了换洗衣服\N{\rEng}I brought you both a change of clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.49,0:52:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}莱顿…\N{\rEng}Leighton…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.37,0:52:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}请帮帮我们\N{\rEng}Please help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.99,0:52:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}很抱歉\N{\rEng}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.25,0:52:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我能做的都做了\N{\rEng}I've done all I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.57,0:53:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}（十分钟内穿好“全部装备”）
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.78,0:53:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}瑞安\N{\rEng}Ryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.64,0:53:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 来 这位是安东尼   - 嗨\N{\rEng}- Come on. This is Anthony.   - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.85,0:53:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}接下来就由他带你们走\N{\rEng}He'll take you the rest of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.82,0:53:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 祝你们好运   - 等等 你不跟我们一起走？\N{\rEng}- Good luck.   - Wait, you're not coming with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.98,0:53:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}监控摄像头被我们搞坏了 若我现在离开 是走不掉的\N{\rEng}We hacked the cameras. If I hurry, it'll be like I never left.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.53,0:53:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 如果被他们发现是你呢？   - 不\N{\rEng}- What if they catch you?   - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.36,0:54:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我得留下做卧底\N{\rEng}I need to stay inside on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.87,0:54:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 为什么？   - 等你们带解药回来\N{\rEng}- Why?   - For when you come back with the cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.12,0:54:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这是我的家园\N{\rEng}This is my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.66,0:54:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我得弥补这个错误\N{\rEng}I have to make this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.58,0:54:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}很抱歉我们带来了这场瘟疫\N{\rEng}I'm so sorry we brought this plague.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.38,0:54:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你们都是好人\N{\rEng}You're good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.50,0:54:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}只是受到了本来不该 被创造出来的东西的波及\N{\rEng}You just got caught up in something that should have never been\Ncreated.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.59,0:54:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好了 你们还有八分钟的时间离开大楼\N{\rEng}All right, you have eight minutes to leave the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.30,0:54:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}去找到那个无多元宇宙国界医生组织\N{\rEng}Find the doctors-without-multiverse-borders
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.05,0:54:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}版本的我\N{\rEng}version of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.47,0:54:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}把解药带回来\N{\rEng}Bring back a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.35,0:54:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}接下来该怎么做？\N{\rEng}What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.35,0:54:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}离盒子越近 路障就越多\N{\rEng}The closer we get to the box, the more blockades.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.35,0:54:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}希望不需要动脑筋另想法子 就能抵达老城区\N{\rEng}Hoping to get to Old Town before we have to get too inventive.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.57,0:54:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}请前往指定的检测队伍\N{\rEng}Proceed to your assigned screening line.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.16,0:54:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 让开…   - 这是为了你们的安全着想\N{\rEng}- Move it! Move it!   - This is for your own safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.33,0:54:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 请走到队伍尾端   - 嘿 放开我\N{\rEng}- Make your way to the end of the line.   - Hey, let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.46,0:54:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}请留下所有随身物品 只需要携带头盔和身份证件\N{\rEng}Leave all belongings, you only need your helmet and\Nidentification card.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.21,0:54:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}下一位 走吧\N{\rEng}Next up. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.51,0:55:02.43,TopDefault,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,32)}- 呈阳性   - 不 没有\N{\rTopEng}- It's positive.   - No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.53,0:55:21.03,TopDefault,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,32)}（道路封闭 控制中心）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.26,0:55:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 我们离盒子还有多远？   - 六个街区\N{\rEng}- How far are we from the box?   - Six blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.26,0:55:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}从这里 通往城市的所有道路都设有路障\N{\rEng}From here, all street access to the city's barricaded,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.22,0:55:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}不过你们可以沿着河边绕过去\N{\rEng}but you can snake along the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.76,0:55:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}你们的薰衣草之翼 和自动注射器都在这个包里\N{\rEng}Your Lavender Wings and your auto-injector are in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.35,0:55:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我来给你们打掩护\N{\rEng}I'm gonna give you guys some cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.64,0:55:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}从这儿到那儿 一路都布满了海军水雷\N{\rEng}All along there are naval mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.86,0:55:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}瘟疫摧毁了密歇根州\N{\rEng}The plague decimated Michigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.52,0:55:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}这些水雷是为了阻止难民靠近\N{\rEng}It's to keep the refugees away.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.07,0:56:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}天啊 这地方变独裁的速度也太快了？\N{\rEng}Oh, God, this place got really authoritarian really fucking fast,\Nhuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.45,0:56:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我会出去制造一场爆炸\N{\rEng}I'm gonna go out there, I'm gonna trigger an explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.95,0:56:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 什么？   - 会尽量不伤到人\N{\rEng}- What?   - As safely as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.41,0:56:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}希望能分散那些看守盒子的守卫的注意力\N{\rEng}It'll hopefully draw the attention of those guarding the box
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.74,0:56:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}给你们足够时间潜入\N{\rEng}and give you guys enough of an opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.16,0:56:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}- 我也只能帮到这里了   - 好的\N{\rEng}- That's the best I can do.   - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.96,0:56:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}嘿 莱顿说你们会带回解药\N{\rEng}Hey, Leighton said you guys would bring back a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.05,0:56:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我爸妈也中了这病毒\N{\rEng}My parents have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.55,0:56:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}我们会的\N{\rEng}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.38,0:56:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}谢谢你\N{\rEng}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.59,0:56:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,1048)}好了 走吧\N{\rEng}Okay. Come on.
